  "title": "The Bigger Welcome Mat",
  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "two-person rivalry",
  "premise": "Two shopkeepers compete with longer welcome mats until the mats cover the whole square and nobody can tell which shop is which. They cut the mats into two clear pathways and leave a shared open patch where a lost customer can finally choose.",
  "hook": "Welcome. More welcome. Maximum welcome.",
  "visible_action": "Mats unroll nose-to-nose, overlap into a striped sea, then retract into two simple routes from one open square.",
  "intended_takeaway_or_theme": "More promotion can mean less clarity.",
